/Summary (Table 3\072The standardised residuals for the olfactory and emotions\056 For the lemon stimulus\054 the standardised residuals show a strong negative association with calm responses \050\0553\05612\051\054 a strong positive association with excited responses \0502\05695\051\054 and a weak positive association with neither responses \0500\05655\051\056 For the vanilla stimulus\054 the standardised residuals indicate a strong positive association with calm responses \0503\05628\051\054 a strong negative association with excited responses \050\0552\05603\051\054 and a weak negative association with neither responses \050\0551\05664\051\056 For the air stimulus\054 the standardised residuals show a slight positive association with calm responses \0501\05610\051\054 a negative association with excited responses \050\0551\05678\051\054 and a weak positive association with neither responses \0500\05633\051\056)
>>
